-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,797</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">78<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">664</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">78<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">603</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">110</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">78<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,225</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">105.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">68w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,183</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">47.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">68w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,212</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">36.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">58w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,337</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">22.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">58w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">This is the Qiaomei Q31 case bought from Taobao, a very simple iGPU/APU case that holds the motherboard with a PICO PSU and includes a top bracket for a single 2.5&quot; SSD drive. CPU cooler height limits range from 53mm with a 7mm thick SSD to 45mm with a 15mm thick drive. No side case fan support, though possibly room for 50mm x 10mm exhaust fans. The build uses an ASRock A620I Lightning WiFi with Ryzen 5 8500G cooled by a mainland China Noctua heatsink with Gigabyte GPU fan, powered by a 300w Flex-ATX PSU. Performance is adequate for APU use—good for 1080p E-Sports and arcade gaming. APU runs warm despite decent cooling, but temperatures are normal for AM5 chips and still faster than Intel UHD graphics despite PCIe x4 speeds. This is a good compact travel build suitable for work, multimedia, and light gaming, larger than NUC or ASRock Deskmini STX but strong performing in its class.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">11,385</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:26%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->74<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">146</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">24<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">47.0<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:22%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->78<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.69</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semib