es a top bracket for a single 2.5\\\\\\\" SSD drive. CPU cooler height limits range from 53mm with a 7mm thick SSD to 45mm with a 15mm thick drive. No side case fan support, though possibly room for 50mm x 10mm exhaust fans. The build uses an ASRock A620I Lightning WiFi with Ryzen 5 8500G cooled by a mainland China Noctua heatsink with Gigabyte GPU fan, powered by a 300w Flex-ATX PSU. Performance is adequate for APU use—good for 1080p E-Sports and arcade gaming. APU runs warm despite decent cooling, but temperatures are normal for AM5 chips and still faster than Intel UHD graphics despite PCIe x4 speeds. This is a good compact travel build suitable for work, multimedia, and light gaming, larger than NUC or ASRock Deskmini STX but strong performing in its class.\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"19:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Performance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"CPU — CB23 Multi\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"11,385\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"width\\\":\\\"26%\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\\\",\\\"children\\\"